---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Slay the Spire 2 Co-op Card Synergies &mdash; Multiplayer Exclusive Cards Guide"
  description="Complete Slay the Spire 2 co-op card synergies: all multiplayer-exclusive cards by character, cross-character combos, team Block/Buff/Redirect cards, and co-op card tier rankings."
>
  <article class="prose prose-invert max-w-none">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-amber-400 not-prose mb-6">
      Card Synergies: Multiplayer Exclusive Cards
    </h1>

    <p class="lead text-lg text-slate-300">
      Co-op introduces cards that don't exist in solo mode — team Block sharing, ally buffs, attack redirection,
      and energy gifts. These cards define co-op deckbuilding and create synergies impossible in single-player.
    </p>

    <nav class="not-prose bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700 my-8" aria-label="Table of Contents">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-400 mb-3">Table of Contents</h2>
      <ol class="text-sm space-y-1 text-slate-300 list-decimal list-inside">
        <li><a href="#how-they-work" class="hover:text-amber-400">How Co-op Cards Work</a></li>
        <li><a href="#ironclad" class="hover:text-amber-400">Ironclad Co-op Cards</a></li>
        <li><a href="#silent" class="hover:text-amber-400">Silent Co-op Cards</a></li>
        <li><a href="#defect" class="hover:text-amber-400">Defect Co-op Cards</a></li>
        <li><a href="#necrobinder" class="hover:text-amber-400">Necrobinder Co-op Cards</a></li>
        <li><a href="#regent" class="hover:text-amber-400">Regent Co-op Cards</a></li>
        <li><a href="#colorless" class="hover:text-amber-400">Colorless Team Cards</a></li>
        <li><a href="#combos" class="hover:text-amber-400">Cross-Character Combos</a></li>
        <li><a href="#tier-list" class="hover:text-amber-400">Co-op Card Tier Rankings</a></li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <!-- How They Work -->
    <section id="how-they-work" class="scroll-mt-20">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-300 mb-4 not-prose">How Co-op Cards Work</h2>
      <p>
        Co-op exclusive cards <strong>only appear in multiplayer runs</strong>. They are offered through normal card rewards,
        shops, and events — but never in solo mode. Each of the five characters has a unique set of multiplayer cards
        alongside a shared pool of Colorless co-op cards available to everyone.
      </p>
      <p>
        These cards create effects that interact with teammates: sharing Block, granting Strength or Energy,
        redirecting enemy attacks, or amplifying damage based on allies' actions.
      </p>

      <div class="not-prose bg-amber-900/30 border border-amber-600/40 rounded-lg p-4 my-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-amber-300"><strong>Critical rule:</strong> Don't skip co-op cards out of solo-play habit. Cards like Rally, Intercept, and Flanking are often run-defining in multiplayer. Their team-wide value far exceeds what the card text alone suggests.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Ironclad -->
    <section id="ironclad" class="scroll-mt-20 mt-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-300 mb-4 not-prose">Ironclad Co-op Cards</h2>

      <div class="not-prose bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-5 border-t-2 border-red-500 mb-4">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-red-400 text-lg mb-2">Demonic Shield</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-2">Skill | Uncommon | 2 Energy (1 when upgraded)</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">Lose 1 HP, then give another player Block equal to your current Block. Synergizes with Ironclad's Barricade and Entrench builds — stack massive Block, then transfer it to a vulnerable teammate. One of the strongest clutch-save tools in co-op.</p>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Ironclad also benefits from all Colorless team Block cards (Rally, Beacon of Hope) and can act as the team's Block battery when built around Barricade + Demonic Shield.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Silent -->
    <section id="silent" class="scroll-mt-20 mt-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-300 mb-4 not-prose">Silent Co-op Cards</h2>

      <div class="not-prose space-y-4">
        <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-5 border-t-2 border-green-500">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-green-400 text-lg mb-2">Flanking</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-2">Skill | Uncommon | 2 Energy (1 when upgraded)</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">Targeted enemy takes <strong>double damage from other players</strong> for the rest of the turn. The Silent who plays it does not benefit — only teammates. Best used before the team unloads their biggest attacks on the same target. Extremely powerful for bursting down bosses and elites.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-700">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-green-400 text-lg mb-2">Sneaky</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-2">Power | Uncommon | 1 Energy</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">Whenever another player attacks, gain 1 Block. Generates passive defense throughout the fight without spending energy. Scales with the number of players — more teammates = more Block per turn cycle. Excellent in 4-player runs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Defect -->
    <section id="defect" class="scroll-mt-20 mt-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-300 mb-4 not-prose">Defect Co-op Cards</h2>

      <div class="not-prose space-y-4">
        <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-5 border-t-2 border-blue-500">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-blue-400 text-lg mb-2">Energy Surge</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-2">Skill | Rare | 0 Energy (Exhaust)</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">ALL players gain 2 Energy. At 0 cost, this is pure upside for the entire team. Enables huge combo turns where every teammate can play their most expensive cards simultaneously. One of the strongest co-op cards in the game.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-700">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-blue-400 text-lg mb-2">Ignition</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-2">Skill | Uncommon | 2 Energy</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">Another player Channels 1 Plasma. Effectively transfers 1 Energy-per-turn to a teammate for the rest of the fight. Powerful when given to energy-hungry characters like Regent (needs energy for Star setup) or Ironclad (expensive high-impact cards).</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Necrobinder -->
    <section id="necrobinder" class="scroll-mt-20 mt-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-300 mb-4 not-prose">Necrobinder Co-op Cards</h2>

      <div class="not-prose space-y-4">
        <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-5 border-t-2 border-purple-500">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-purple-400 text-lg mb-2">Legion of Bone</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-2">Skill | Rare | 2 Energy (Exhaust)</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">ALL players Summon 6. Grants Osty (Necrobinder's bodyguard minion) to <strong>every player on the team</strong>. Transforms the entire party into off-tanks. In 4-player, this means four Ostys absorbing hits — incredibly powerful for survivability.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-700">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-purple-400 text-lg mb-2">Glimpse Beyond</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-2">Skill | Uncommon | 1 Energy</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">ALL players add 3 Souls into their draw pile. Souls are 0-cost cards that draw 1 and Exhaust. Gives the entire team free cycle and deck velocity. Enables Necrobinder's retrieval mechanics across the team.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Regent -->
    <section id="regent" class="scroll-mt-20 mt-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-300 mb-4 not-prose">Regent Co-op Cards</h2>

      <div class="not-prose bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-5 border-t-2 border-yellow-500 mb-4">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-yellow-400 text-lg mb-2">Largesse</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-2">Skill | Uncommon | 1 Energy</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">Another player adds a random Colorless card to their hand. Gives teammates extra options and can high-roll into powerful co-op Colorless cards like Rally or Intercept. Low cost, always useful.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Colorless Team Cards -->
    <section id="colorless" class="scroll-mt-20 mt-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-300 mb-4 not-prose">Colorless Team Cards (Available to All)</h2>

      <div class="not-prose grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-400 mb-2">Rally</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-1">Skill | Uncommon | 2 Energy</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">ALL players gain 12 Block. Universally useful — effectively 48 Block of value in a 4-player run for 2 energy.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-400 mb-2">Beacon of Hope</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-1">Power | Rare | 2 Energy</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">Whenever you gain Block, other players gain half as much. Turns any Block engine into team-wide protection.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-400 mb-2">Intercept</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-1">Skill | Uncommon | 2 Energy</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">Gain 9 Block and redirect all attacks targeting another player to you. The ultimate clutch save for protecting low-HP teammates.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-400 mb-2">Coordinate</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-1">Skill | Uncommon | 1 Energy</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">Give another player +5 Strength this turn. Drop on your burst DPS before they unload attacks.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-400 mb-2">Gang Up</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-1">Attack | Uncommon | 1 Energy</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">Deal 5 damage + 5 for each time another player attacked that enemy this turn. Devastating in 4-player coordinated turns.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-400 mb-2">Tag Team</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-1">Attack | Uncommon | 2 Energy</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">Deal 11 damage. Another player's next attack on that enemy is played twice. Combines explosively with heavy single-hit attacks.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-400 mb-2">Mimic</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-1">Skill | Uncommon | 1 Energy</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">Gain Block equal to the Block on another player. Let your tank stack Block, then copy it for free.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-400 mb-2">Lift</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-1">Skill | Common | 1 Energy</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">Give another player 11 Block. Simple, efficient, always useful protection for a vulnerable teammate.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Cross-Character Combos -->
    <section id="combos" class="scroll-mt-20 mt-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-300 mb-4 not-prose">Cross-Character Card Combos</h2>

      <div class="not-prose space-y-4">
        <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-700">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Flanking + Tag Team + Heavy Attack</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">Silent plays Flanking (double damage from others), then player 2 plays Tag Team (next ally attack is doubled), then player 3 plays their strongest single hit. Result: massive multiplicatively stacked damage on one target.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-700">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Legion of Bone + Sneaky + Beacon of Hope</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">Necrobinder gives everyone Osty. Silent's Sneaky triggers Block from every attack each player makes. Beacon of Hope distributes that Block to the team. The entire party becomes nearly unkillable.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-700">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Energy Surge + Coordinate + Star Detonation</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">Defect plays Energy Surge (+2 energy to all). Then Coordinate (+5 Strength to Regent). Regent uses the extra energy to play Star-generating cards and detonates with +5 Strength. Boss-melting single turn.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-700">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Demonic Shield + Mimic</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">Ironclad stacks 80+ Block via Barricade/Entrench, then Demonic Shields it to a teammate. Another player Mimics it back. Both players now have massive Block. You've cloned the tank's defense.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-700">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Glimpse Beyond + Discard Synergies</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">Necrobinder gives everyone Souls (0-cost draw). Silent's discard-triggered effects and Sly keyword cards activate from the extra cycle. The whole team draws through their decks faster.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-700">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Ignition + Energy-Hungry Builds</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">Defect gives Plasma to Regent or Ironclad early in the fight. The extra energy every turn enables expensive powers and Star generators that would otherwise be too slow.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Tier List -->
    <section id="tier-list" class="scroll-mt-20 mt-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-300 mb-4 not-prose">Co-op Card Tier Rankings</h2>

      <div class="not-prose space-y-4">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-400 mb-2">S-Tier — Run-Defining</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-2">Take these almost always. They fundamentally change how your team operates.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="bg-amber-600/20 text-amber-400 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded">Energy Surge</span>
            <span class="bg-amber-600/20 text-amber-400 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded">Legion of Bone</span>
            <span class="bg-amber-600/20 text-amber-400 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded">Flanking</span>
            <span class="bg-amber-600/20 text-amber-400 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded">Beacon of Hope</span>
            <span class="bg-amber-600/20 text-amber-400 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded">Demonic Shield</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-green-400 mb-2">A-Tier — Strong Includes</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-2">Highly valuable in most team comps. Draft aggressively.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="bg-green-600/20 text-green-400 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded">Rally</span>
            <span class="bg-green-600/20 text-green-400 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded">Coordinate</span>
            <span class="bg-green-600/20 text-green-400 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded">Intercept</span>
            <span class="bg-green-600/20 text-green-400 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded">Tag Team</span>
            <span class="bg-green-600/20 text-green-400 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded">Gang Up</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-blue-400 mb-2">B-Tier — Situationally Strong</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-2">Strong in the right comp but not auto-includes.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="bg-blue-600/20 text-blue-400 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded">Sneaky</span>
            <span class="bg-blue-600/20 text-blue-400 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded">Ignition</span>
            <span class="bg-blue-600/20 text-blue-400 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded">Largesse</span>
            <span class="bg-blue-600/20 text-blue-400 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded">Mimic</span>
            <span class="bg-blue-600/20 text-blue-400 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded">Glimpse Beyond</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-400 mb-2">C-Tier — Filler</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-2">Fine if you have synergy, otherwise skip.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="bg-slate-700 text-slate-400 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded">Lift</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>

  <div class="not-prose mt-12 flex justify-between items-center">
    <a href="/coop/character-combos/" class="text-amber-400 hover:underline">&larr; Character Combos</a>
    <a href="/coop/boss-strategies/" class="inline-block bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-500 text-black font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors">
      Boss Strategies: Co-op Boss Tactics &rarr;
    </a>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
